{"parentUuid":"6063e720-5888-41a4-8b8d-a60e6cafebda","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a6ee5badc37477fc2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014h5cqc7cLV9YEJcwxXzqhh","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"id\": \"C-PAL\", \"layer\": 0, \"owner\": \"platform-architect\", \"name\": \"Platform abstraction layer\", \"summary\": \"OS services, CPU/GPU capability discovery and device database, windowing, display & safe area, lifecycle and system events (memory pressure, thermal/power, network reachability, audio endpoint, locale, OS accessibility settings, overlay/focus, storage, page size), clocks and clock-domain correlation, processes/pipes/shared memory/dev sockets, HTTP(S)/TLS client, permissions, thread creation/affinity/QoS and main-thread dispatch. Platform code lives only in the PAL or in a registered platform backend slot.\", \"requires\": [\"C-BASE\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-TYPES\", \"layer\": 1, \"owner\": \"containers-core-types\", \"name\": \"Core types & containers\", \"summary\": \"Containers, strings, versioned stable hashing, general-purpose compression codecs, vetted cryptographic primitives wrapper, ownership/view types.\", \"requires\": [\"C-MEM\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-IO\", \"layer\": 2, \"owner\": \"async-io-storage\", \"name\": \"Async IO\", \"summary\": \"IO requests, priorities, deadlines, completions, decompression targets.\", \"requires\": [\"C-PAL\", \"C-TASK\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-ASSET\", \"layer\": 2, \"owner\": \"content-pipeline-architect\", \"name\": \"Asset identity & references\", \"summary\": \"Asset IDs, soft/hard references, dependency declaration, registry queries.\", \"requires\": [\"C-SER\", \"C-ID\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-EDCMD\", \"layer\": 5, \"owner\": \"editor-architect\", \"name\": \"Editor commands & tool extension\", \"summary\": \"Transactions, undo/redo, selection, tool registration.\", \"requires\": [\"C-REFL\", \"C-SER\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-TEST\", \"layer\": \"P\", \"owner\": \"test-architect\", \"name\": \"Test & validation definition of done\", \"summary\": \"Required test kinds per skill, test determinism, coverage & mutation thresholds, the evidence bundle an implementer hands to S3/S4 critics, oracle independence, conformance suites owned by contract owners with consumer-driven additions.\", \"requires\": [], \"universal\": \"all\"}\n{\"id\": \"C-BASE\", \"layer\": 0, \"owner\": \"platform-architect\", \"name\": \"Bootstrap base\", \"summary\": \"Raw page allocator, raw log/assert/abort sink, monotonic clock, raw thread primitives and late-bound hook tables that higher layers install (allocator, log sink, assert handler, crash annotator). Depends on nothing.\", \"requires\": [], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-IPC\", \"layer\": 2, \"owner\": \"core-runtime-architect\", \"name\": \"Engine IPC\", \"summary\": \"Process model and IPC/RPC transport for editor\\u2194runtime, tool workers, crash handler, profiler and script debugger; dev-only port security.\", \"requires\": [\"C-PAL\", \"C-TASK\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-REPLAY\", \"layer\": 3, \"owner\": \"determinism-replay\", \"name\": \"Replay container & streams\", \"summary\": \"Replay container, timeline, stream registration (input, replication, visual log, animation debug, external/nondeterministic inputs) and cross-build versioning.\", \"requires\": [\"C-SNAPSHOT\", \"C-SER\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-REP\", \"layer\": 3, \"owner\": \"replication\", \"name\": \"Replication\", \"summary\": \"Replicated state declaration, relevancy hooks, RPCs, net IDs, batch registration, replay and spectator streams.\", \"requires\": [\"C-NETLINK\", \"C-SER\", \"C-ID\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-AIAGENT\", \"layer\": 4, \"owner\": \"ai-behavior-perception\", \"name\": \"AI decision-provider extension point\", \"summary\": \"Optional decision providers (learned policies, LLM agents) with budget, timeout, moderation and authored fallback.\", \"requires\": [\"C-GAME\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-DEVUI\", \"layer\": 3, \"owner\": \"visual-debugging-tools\", \"name\": \"Developer UI\", \"summary\": \"Immediate-mode developer UI and debug menus available in development builds on every target.\", \"requires\": [\"C-DRAW2D\"], \"conformance\": true}\n{\"id\": \"C-EDHOST\", \"layer\": 5, \"owner\": \"editor-ui-framework\", \"name\": \"Editor host\", \"summary\": \"Asset-editor host, preview-scene registration, thumbnail providers, inspector customization, tool-mode registration, shared curve/timeline widgets.\", \"requires\": [\"C-EDCMD\"], \"conformance\": true}\n- Central sequential update loop\n- Per-object virtual Tick()\n- Game-thread / render-thread dichotomy\n- Main-thread-only engine APIs\n- Pervasive inheritance object hierarchies\n- Possession / controller-pawn model by habit\n- Universal scene graph\n- Hidden globals & singletons\n- Process-global mutable cvars read anywhere\n- Hot-path virtual dispatch across contracts\n- Coarse locks & global renderer sync\n- Draw-call-centric CPU submission on capable tiers\n- DX11/OpenGL binding & sync assumptions\n- Per-object render proxy mirror\n- Frame-tied resource lifetimes\n- Synchronous IO / blocking loads\n- Page-fault-driven streaming\n- Level-as-a-file loading\n- Immediate synchronous observer callbacks across subsystems\n- Stringly-typed reflection on runtime paths\n- Tracing-GC-managed engine objects\n- Global script VM on one thread\n- Editor-in-runtime monolith\n- Blocking cook-before-play\n- Single-thread-first design\n- Monolithic subsystems\n- ECS for everything / GPU-driven everywhere (new dogma)\nR M Cloud game streaming targets ['PLAT.PAL.cloud-streaming']\nR X Cloud-hybrid compute (split client/cloud simulation) ['PLAT.PAL.cloud-hybrid']\nR M ECS relationships ['CORE.ECS.relationships']\nR M C++26 static reflection ['CORE.REFL.generation']\nR M Memory-safe language components ['CORE.LIFE.interop', 'XC.SEC.memory-safety']\nR M OpenUSD as interchange backbone ['CNT.IMP.usd']\nR M MaterialX / OpenPBR interchange & model ['CNT.IMP.materialx', 'RND.MAT.openpbr']\nR M Remote/CDN content streaming at runtime ['RES.IO.remote']\nR M Planetary & geospatial worlds ['WLD.MODEL.planetary', 'WLD.ENV.terrain-planetary', 'CNT.IMP.geospatial']\nR X ML-generated content in PCG ['WLD.PCG.ml']\nR X Work graphs & mesh nodes ['RND.GRAPH.work-graphs', 'RND.GEO.mesh-nodes']\nR X Neural materials ['RND.MAT.neural']\nR M Cluster/virtualized geometry refinements (deforming LOD, displacement) ['RND.LOD.deforming', 'RND.LOD.displacement']\nR M Sampler-feedback streaming ['RND.TEX.feedback']\nR X Neural texture compression ['RND.TEX.ntc']\nR M Stochastic many-light sampling ['RND.LIGHT.stochastic']\nR M ReSTIR GI & path-traced GI ['RND.GI.restir', 'RND.PT.realtime']\nR M Neural radiance caching ['RND.GI.neural-cache']\nR M Advanced RT hardware features (OMM, SER, cluster BLAS) ['RND.RT.omm', 'RND.RT.ser', 'RND.RT.cluster-blas']\nR M ML denoising & ray reconstruction ['RND.RECON.denoise']\nR M Strand hair simulation & rendering ['RND.CHAR.hair', 'PHY.SOFT.hair-sim']\nR M Foveated rendering implementation ['RND.RECON.foveation']\nR M ACES 2.0 output transforms ['RND.POST.aces2']\nR M Heterogeneous sparse volumes ['RND.VFX.volumes']\nR M Slang shading language ['RND.SHADER.slang']\nR M In-shader neural evaluation & differentiable shaders ['RND.SHADER.neural', 'RND.SHADER.autodiff']\nR M WebGPU backend & web 3D ['RND.RHI.webgpu', 'PLAT.WEB.webgpu-target']\nR X Gaussian splatting & radiance fields ['RND.GEO.splats', 'RND.GEO.splat-relight', 'CNT.IMP.splats']\nR M ML runtime (inference, packaging, scheduling, NPU) ['ML.RT.inference', 'ML.RT.packaging', 'ML.RT.scheduling', 'ML.RT.training-boundary', 'ML.RT.determinism', 'ML.RT.npu']\nR M GPU physics offload ['PHY.ARCH.gpu']\nR M SDF collision ['PHY.COL.sdf']\nR M Particle & GPU fluids ['PHY.FLUID.particles', 'PHY.FLUID.gpu']\nR X ML cloth & learned deformables ['PHY.SOFT.ml']\nR M ML deformers ['ANM.DEF.ml']\nR M Learned motion & neural controllers ['ANM.SYN.learned']\nR M Audio-driven & ML lip sync ['ANM.FACE.lipsync']\nR M Wave-based acoustic propagation ['AUD.SPAT.propagation']\nR M Runtime neural speech (TTS/ASR) ['AUD.CONTENT.speech']\nR X Seamless server meshing ['NET.ARCH.meshing']\nR M QUIC/WebTransport game transport ['NET.TRANS.quic']\nR M Learned & LLM-driven agents ['GAM.AI.learned', 'GAM.AI.llm']\nR M Generative authoring tools ['ED.AI.generative', 'ED.AI.provenance', 'ED.AI.evaluation', 'CNT.COOK.ml-assisted']\nR M Agent/automation control API (MCP class) ['ED.ARCH.agent-api', 'QA.FUNC.agent-exploration']\nR M GPU & training cook steps ['CNT.COOK.gpu-steps']\nR M Generative-AI service boundary & guardrails ['PLAT.SVC.genai-boundary', 'XC.SEC.genai']\nR M Mixed reality & spatial computing ['PLAT.XR.scene', 'PLAT.XR.anchors', 'PLAT.XR.depth-occlusion', 'PLAT.XR.gaze-input', 'PLAT.XR.light-estimation']\nR E Eye tracking as desktop input ['INP.DEV.eye-tracking']\nR M Autostereo / light-field displays ['RND.ARCH.multiview']\nR S RISC-V targets []\nR S Brain-computer input []\nR S CXL memory tiers []\nR S Explicit multi-GPU []\nR E Backend service implementation []\nM M0 Walking skeleton []\nM M1 Indie 2D vertical slice []\nM M2 Standard 3D []\nM M3 Open world & large simulation []\nM M4 Online ['anti-cheat-integrity']\nM M5 AAA & ecosystem []","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ce101287-74af-481b-9be3-6dbbbf92cff7","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:02.454Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6063e720-5888-41a4-8b8d-a60e6cafebda","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
