{"parentUuid":"f2e2588c-3558-4fdf-a7a8-c5c42f37004f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"a6ee5badc37477fc2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Kq2yd5w8moEemg52x2KdKD","type":"tool_result","content":"45:   ARCH.ORG.provenance | Per-change agent/model/task attestation in the ledger | program-orchestration | E | ['security-engineering']\n171:   CORE.MATH.spmd | Wide-SIMD / SPMD kernels for fixed and scalable (VLA) vector ISAs, runtime ISA dispatch | math-simd-numerics | E | ['cpu-performance']\n380:   WLD.ENV.fog | Volumetric fog & local participating media | atmosphere-weather | E\n775:   AUD.DSP.codecs | Codecs & decoding (Opus, Vorbis, ADPCM, hardware) | audio-dsp-mixing | E\n778:   AUD.DSP.voip | Voice-chat capture, echo cancellation & processing | audio-dsp-mixing | E | ['network-transport']\n825:   NET.ARCH.model | Netcode model selection (authoritative server, lockstep, rollback, P2P/relay) | network-architect | E\n846:   NET.TRANS.voice | Game-transport voice path (P2P/server-relayed) | network-transport | E | ['audio-dsp-mixing']\n852:   NET.REP.interest | Interest management / relevancy | replication | E | ['world-architect']\n863:   NET.PRED.lockstep | Deterministic lockstep | prediction-rollback | E | ['determinism-replay']\n867:   NET.PRED.lockstep-replay | Shipping input-stream replays for lockstep games | prediction-rollback | E | ['determinism-replay']\n453:  \"multiplayer security\": [\n454-   \"NET.TRANS.crypto\",\n455-   \"XC.SEC.server-validation\"\n456-  ],\n457-  \"persistence\": [\n458-   \"GAM.SAVE.world-state\"\n459-  ],\n460-  \"save games\": [\n461-   \"GAM.SAVE.model\"","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8a84880f-a791-4623-87f0-97a7778d81af","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:25:50.797Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f2e2588c-3558-4fdf-a7a8-c5c42f37004f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b8